      "group": "第34小节",
      "group_id": "g5",
      "text": "941. 已知：\n1) 函数$f$和$g$的定义域都是集合$M$；\n2) $f$是增函数；\n3) $g$是减函数；\n4) $a\\in M,b\\in M$。\n说明下列命题是否真命题：\na) $(f(a)>f(b))\\Longrightarrow(a>b)$；\nb) $(g(a)>g(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；\nc) $(f(a)<f(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；\nd) $(g(a)<g(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；\ne) $(a\\ne b)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{f(a)-f(b)}{a-b}>0\\right)$；\nf) $(a\\ne b)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{g(a)-g(b)}{a-b}<0\\right)$。",
      "lines": [
        "941. 已知：",
        "1) 函数$f$和$g$的定义域都是集合$M$；",
        "2) $f$是增函数；",
        "3) $g$是减函数；",
        "4) $a\\in M,b\\in M$。",
        "说明下列命题是否真命题：",
        "a) $(f(a)>f(b))\\Longrightarrow(a>b)$；",
        "b) $(g(a)>g(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；",
        "c) $(f(a)<f(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；",
        "d) $(g(a)<g(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；",
        "e) $(a\\ne b)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{f(a)-f(b)}{a-b}>0\\right)$；",
        "f) $(a\\ne b)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{g(a)-g(b)}{a-b}<0\\right)$。"
      ],
